# Festag Design Constitution (condensed)

Full law: `docs/festag-design-constitution.md`. Revised 2026-08-22 — replaces the
"Read Mode / warm paper" version. Product rules unchanged; visual rules replaced.
Calm is still the goal. Calm is not the same as faint.

## Ground

Neutral, not warm. Light: ground `#F7F7F8`, card `#FFFFFF`. Dark: ground `#0B0B0D`,
card `#141416`. Depth is **elevation, not borders**. Max two elevation levels visible
at once. No gradient decoration, no glassmorphism.

## Colour

Ink carries hierarchy, colour carries state. **Every text pair clears 4.5:1** — the old
palette shipped 2.4:1 secondary text; check before you land a pair. Accent `#2E6BFF` is
for state and focus only — never a provider-button fill, never decoration. Tone tokens
(`--fst-tone`: wait/watch/good/quiet) mark what a thing needs.

## One primary action

Exactly one filled action per surface, and it is what the screen is for. Primary = solid
`--text`, inverted label. Secondary = `--surface-2`, no border. Provider buttons
(Google/Apple/SSO) are **secondary**. If two things look equally clickable, one is wrong.

## Radius

8 inputs/chips · 12 buttons/rows · 20 cards/popovers · 28 sheets/modals · 999 avatars,
badges, standalone CTA. Step, don't jump — no 6px control inside a 28px card.

## Elevation

sm `0 1px 2px/.05` · md `0 4px 16px/.07` · lg `0 12px 32px/.10` · xl `0 24px 64px/.14`.
Only things that float cast one. A permanent rail casts nothing — a shadow with nothing
casting it is a smudge.

## Typography

Editorial titles = Editors Note Medium. Everything else Aeonik Regular; Medium is opt-in
for one element. **Aeonik Bold forbidden.** One type scale for desktop and mobile.

## Motion

Press 70ms · hover/focus 130ms · panel 180–240ms · route 200ms. Micro-interactions are
**faster** than layout changes, never slower. A covering surface is opaque before it
covers. All of it collapses under `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Patterns

Lists = `components/festag/festag-rows.ts`, not card grids. People = person card with a
real action; roles from `lib/platform/roles.ts` (`client`/`developer`/`designer` are real
— do not invent parallel role systems). Mobile chrome = `festag-mobile-ui.mdc`; a
scrolling strip must show that it scrolls.

## Gate

1 Why visible now? · 2 Exactly one filled action? · 3 Every pair ≥4.5:1? · 4 Elevation
not borders? · 5 Micro faster than layout? · 6 Mobile native? · 7 Does the action change
something real?
